icy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/WVtFob6TRgooBQejcxFiaFibibBiawLpmE13LBgUYGtA4m8yqQibfibTUxt1OJ2t8j6ddiaoIZmbDqmnqP0yjXaaibOxicrDacG1rJpq7jcWUJv67PxQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/EwO5G1lia5BQ8QLWBSRtFrvSFR7PvukrlyGbYyzt8KADmEdiabQj7ibbDocqXG9PpTbdpAdcRCGvfzIPfgnEJdpJCqLz9TgvOs5W6lIRVqVPRY/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/WVtFob6TRgoELT9p1uzeURfqrbLJz6wiapqAaj8Ge4wfsw2ZoibFrYbNJicjRau6fUpmfSIZYX8IsdOBadm1JbbmAtkibN3CdaqZuN3uEygasicU/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/WVtFob6TRgr8bK7257Y4xS9yPYIKtm0d7MWickR4VrkS2DLVIpOiar4tjc6vqEFN8oCAYWF9AYWtU4fCWVGHZTl54ibMicu2eaUBYl2icZh54ic7c/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section><section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/CMNkNOjRtsQmCrR8Z7uzXTcJXhKAIWABcia4CZr7gDZkDabx4lf975F0IkpsBlcIqRt5I4icF0rCOmYp1HdUtySZKoiaOt1rbXuqmOHUjYHiaOg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>北京理工大学经济学院在经济学领域拥有完善的学科布局，设有理论经济学、应用经济学两个一级学科博士点，能源与气候经济、国民经济动员学两个交叉学科博士点，应用经济学博士后流动站，理论经济学与应用经济学优势互补，新兴交叉学科快速发展。学院现已开设</span><span><strong><span>金融</span></strong></span><strong><span>、</span><span><span>数字经济</span></span></strong><span>两个专业硕士（以下简称“专硕”）学位点，并拟新增</span><span><strong><span>低空经济</span></strong></span><span>专硕学位点。</span></p></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><p><strong><span>01</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>项目介绍</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/WVtFob6TRgr8bK7257Y4xS9yPYIKtm0d7MWickR4VrkS2DLVIpOiar4tjc6vqEFN8oCAYWF9AYWtU4fCWVGHZTl54ibMicu2eaUBYl2icZh54ic7c/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>    学院专硕项目依托北京理工大学人工智能、绿色能源、国防科技等全国领先的工科优势与深厚学科积淀，汇聚实力雄厚、经验丰富的跨学科师资团队，由国家级学术领军人才与资深教授领衔，团队兼具扎实教学能力与丰富实践经验，荣获教育部人文社科一等奖、国家级及省部级教学成果奖等多项重要奖励；拥有国家自然科学基金创新研究群体、国家级优青人才等高层次人才梯队，建有工信部重点实验室、北京市哲社基地等省部级科研平台，“十四五”期间签约科研项目百余项，主持国家级重大重点项目十余项，年均在Nature、Journal of Finance、《经济研究》《管理世界》等国内外顶级期刊发表高水平论文百余篇，科研基础雄厚、创新能力突出。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/CMNkNOjRtsSowEB89DJ5E9Cp1N753UQGlmkVGuibvVMv5ZfcOiaIw5G2FgfNRVvHGiaZdeic2z5hSMo3y7Fyvl63oOAguWibwDLJjYiaaHLX83oO8/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/CMNkNOjRtsQBO7Oict5Jkj0rYG7cLws69NzsdTXiazLUy35dR48DSyy6qaBmbVbk2nfhFwN7nUXhia9dMFwuJkWQxcmjH4HZkotTuhokyCuVVo/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>    学院专硕项目立足学校工科优势与经济学传统，整合优质校友资源，聚焦金融科技、量化投资、绿色金融、人工智能、大数据等前沿领域，面向金融机构、数字经济产业、互联网平台、政府监管与治理部门等多元领域，打造</span><strong><span>“理工+金融”</span></strong><span>、</span><strong><span>“数字+经济”</span></strong><span>深度融合的鲜明培养特色，构建交叉复合型人才培养体系。</span></p></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/WVtFob6TRgr8bK7257Y4xS9yPYIKtm0d7MWickR4VrkS2DLVIpOiar4tjc6vqEFN8oCAYWF9AYWtU4fCWVGHZTl54ibMicu2eaUBYl2icZh54ic7c/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/CMNkNOjRtsShlw84ia34XLUfL5S4hJ4uRAFvZgT4rPIyf2iatvFMGsMsAuwX4ibYQ5FzjKnRnkUoCGiaXNljY1OfeosM2oiayldAXmCTjyCEAiclg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section><section><p><span>    项目致力于培养具备坚实的经济学理论基础，系统掌握经济学、统计学、管理学、计算机科学、数量方法等核心知识与现代数字技能，能够融会贯通多学科理论方法、紧密对接中国发展实践，熟练开展经济与金融大数据分析、产业数字化规划、金融创新实践等工作，胜任经济金融管理、数字经济治理、产业创新发展等岗位需求，成为契合国家战略与行业发展需要的高素质复合型专业人才。</span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><p><strong><span>02</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>暑期活动安排</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/WVtFob6TRgr8bK7257Y4xS9yPYIKtm0d7MWickR4VrkS2DLVIpOiar4tjc6vqEFN8oCAYWF9AYWtU4fCWVGHZTl54ibMicu2eaUBYl2icZh54ic7c/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>    2026年暑假，我院计划召开两场</span><strong><span><span>专硕专题学术沙龙活动</span></span></strong><span>，内容包括</span><span><span>专业公开课、招生政策解读、企业导师见面会、校园参观</span></span><span>等，活动时间如下：</span></p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/CMNkNOjRtsSdWbTrDRZqp0gNFFJrs3F3KPFmLvwSxlOTtdTR7smSdqics18HgRyibegpdEbicN8hcIAAhq0xp9usRBHGXXr023QTxaJY1cibmLU/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><p><strong><span><span>    活动专属奖学金</span></span></strong><span>：参加专硕暑期活动（线下/线上），录取后可获专属奖学金。</span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><p><strong><span>03</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>报名方式</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/WVtFob6TRgr8bK7257Y4xS9yPYIKtm0d7MWickR4VrkS2DLVIpOiar4tjc6vqEFN8oCAYWF9AYWtU4fCWVGHZTl54ibMicu2eaUBYl2icZh54ic7c/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>    有意向参与专硕暑期活动的同学可扫描下方专属报名二维码进行报名，按要求如实填写个人信息，完成线上报名登记。</span></p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/CMNkNOjRtsR9aKwUoNjefhuppvWRN7bRcQ8UXKsx5v1f3mEEOeY1NCb6JJuGFOcCic8EnPwaJPTDE5P2nng2EQC1TxOFdwEjtOy6p8IErUT4/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><p><strong><span><span>   线下活动席位数量有限，采用先到先得的原则，额满即止。</span></span></strong><span>请意向参与者及时完成报名，成功报名的同学后续可关注学院官方通知，及时查收活动具体入场、参会相关事宜。</span></p></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/CMNkNOjRtsQDoialUaboeAe564apfDzbwovAkJVpeIwXTp1JR96ENnSlFFaSIlLmC5libt74BmO2OWw0J5AZS4Xe68KR7UO0m7Jfxf586z4D0/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section></section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/WVtFob6TRgoELT9p1uzeURfqrbLJz6wiapqAaj8Ge4wfsw2ZoibFrYbNJicjRau6fUpmfSIZYX8IsdOBadm1JbbmAtkibN3CdaqZuN3uEygasicU/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>04</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>联系方式</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/WVtFob6TRgr8bK7257Y4xS9yPYIKtm0d7MWickR4VrkS2DLVIpOiar4tjc6vqEFN8oCAYWF9AYWtU4fCWVGHZTl54ibMicu2eaUBYl2icZh54ic7c/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></secti